# FreeRADIUS mods-config/files/authorize for radius-admin-pap-freeradius.
#
# The password is stored HASHED, as {sha256} over the fixture password
# "fixture-pap-secret". PAP works against this form because ze sends the
# password and the server hashes what it received. CHAP would not, and
# radius-admin-chap-hashed-freeradius proves it.
#
# Filter-Id names the ze authorization profile the login must end up with.
# RFC 2865 Section 5.11 calls it "the filter list for this user", which is what
# a ze profile is.
radiusop	Password-With-Header := "{sha256}+QDCWcnn5kTK8xqKEm6cExY9fNHh0vUj/hfVyYRtx3s="
		Filter-Id = "interop-operator"
